# Cursor Rules for ThangNhayDay All-in-One Web App

## 1. Project Architecture & Framework Rules
- Framework: Vite Multi-page with Vanilla ES Modules (`index.html` and `admin.html`).
- Backend: Cloudflare Pages Functions located in `/functions/api/`. Do NOT use Node server frameworks (e.g. Express).
- Database: Cloudflare D1 SQL Database with SQLite syntax. Bind name is `env.DB`.
- Styling: Cyberpunk / Neon Dark Mode using Tailwind CDN + custom rules in `src/styles/main.css` and `src/styles/admin.css`.

## 2. Navigation & Tabs
- The application has 2 primary tabs in `index.html`:
  - Tab 1: "🛍️ ĐỒ TẬP & PHỤ KIỆN" (Active by default on open).
  - Tab 2: "🎮 TRÒ CHƠI (ARCADE 4-IN-1)".
- When switching to Tab 2 or refreshing, ALWAYS ensure the default game centered and active is "Thắng Nhảy Dây" (`jump`) via `carousel.resetToDefault()`.

## 3. Mini-Games Architecture (4 Games)
- All mini-games reside in `src/games/` and inherit from `BaseGame.js` (`init(canvas)`, `start()`, `pause()`, `destroy()`).
- Coordinated solely through `GameController.js` rendering into a SINGLE shared canvas `#arcadeCanvas` inside `.arcade-cabinet-frame`.
- When any game starts or modal is active, enforce Mobile Fullscreen Scroll Lock (`document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden'`, `touch-action: none`, and `touchmove` default prevented).
- Game-specific requirements:
  - `jump` (Thắng Nhảy Dây): Default game, has Weekly gift race (`week_id`) + All-Time records. Modal asks for optional Zalo contact.
  - `snake` (Cyber Snake): Big 4-button D-Pad on mobile, wrap-around wall logic.
  - `2048` (2048 Neon): NO on-screen buttons. Pure touch swipe control.
  - `tetris` (Xếp Hình Neon): Ghost piece disabled. Only Left/Right buttons, Rotate button on far right, Hard Drop button in the center.

## 4. Game Carousel (True Infinite Loop)
- Located in `src/modules/carousel.js`.
- MUST maintain 6 DOM cards: `[Clone Tetris (0)] - [1. Nhảy Dây] - [2. Rắn] - [3. 2048] - [4. Tetris] - [Clone Nhảy Dây (5)]`.
- MUST NOT use `scroll-behavior: smooth` in `.carousel-container` CSS to avoid rewind lag.
- When scroll ends on index 5: instantly teleport `scrollLeft` to index 1 with `behavior: 'auto'` / `'instant'` while temporarily disabling `scroll-snap-type`.
- When scroll ends on index 0: instantly teleport `scrollLeft` to index 4.

## 5. Leaderboard & Security
- Managed via `functions/api/leaderboard.ts` and `src/modules/leaderboard.js`.
- Public GET endpoint MUST NEVER return `pin_hash` or `contact_info`.
- Only `type=admin_weekly` can expose `contact_info` and `pin_hash` to the admin portal.
- All PINs are hashed using SHA-256 via Web Crypto API (`crypto.subtle.digest('SHA-256')`).
- Only `jump` supports weekly prize racing. All other games (`snake`, `2048`, `tetris`) are strictly All-Time only.

## 6. Admin Portal (/admin.html)
- Main sub-navigation:
  - Tab 1: "🛍️ Quản Trị Sản Phẩm Affiliate": Synchronizes `src/data/products.json` via GitHub REST API with Base64 encoding. Default repo is `ducthangqtm/affgames`.
  - Tab 2: "🎁 Trao Giải Đua Top Tuần": Week selector (`week_id`), Top 1 Winner Card with Zalo chat link, and client-side SHA-256 PIN Verification tool ("Khớp PIN - Chính chủ" vs "Sai PIN").

## 7. Donate Modal
- Modal `#donateModal` must remain visual and clean:
  - Display large centered VietQR MoMo image (`/assets/qr-donate.jpg`).
  - DO NOT display plain text bank account or phone numbers.
  - Prominent MoMo button linking to `https://me.momo.vn/0987654321` and a dismiss button.
